{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_readme": [
    "Shared Claude Code settings for this repository. COMMITTED.",
    "Personal overrides go in .claude/settings.local.json (git-ignored) and must never loosen the deny list.",
    "The deny list mirrors .bearing/bin/brg-guard --verbs; the PreToolUse hook runs the guard itself,",
    "which also catches wrappers (sudo, env, sh -c, git -C). The owner pushes and deploys; the agent prepares.",
    "PostToolUse lints each edited file through make check-file (or the guard's fallback)."
  ],
  "permissions": {
    "allow": [
